<title>ESTONIA: RAKVERE SAYS WILL RELEASE Q1 RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RAKVERE SAYS WILL RELEASE Q1 RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rakvere meat factory said on Monday it will release its first quarter results before June 5.</p>
<p>Rakvere and Saku Brewery are the only free market companies on the Tallinn bourse which have not released their first quarter results.</p>
<p>Under new rules that come into force on June 5, companies on the free market must release regular results, including quarterly figures, or face the suspension of its stock.</p>
<p>&quot;Everything leads us to assume we will release the information before June 5,&quot; a company spokesperson told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 6 209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
